recommend keep-going the arc has heard the person it reached, which is where a correspondence honestly ends: a matter comes round twice, meets a wall, reaches a person, and that person's own word lands where an operator reads it. The next lap is not another rung -- the meter refuses one. Lift the four chained check bodies (check_<rung>, its refusals, its measure, and its wire) into ladder_checks.rye so a new rung costs stubs rather than bodies, and the ceiling opens for whatever the arc wants to say next.
